  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "UNOSAT satellite-detected water polygons from 194 per-event collections, in one GeoParquet file with a shared set of columns: `event`, `event_code`, `collection`, `source_layer`, `source_file`, `license`, `water_class`, `water_class_code`, `sensor_date`, `sensor`, `confidence`, `assessment_epoch`, and 2D EPSG:4326 geometry. Rows carry their own `license` column. Included: CC BY-SA (as HDX states it, no version), CC BY 4.0, and CC BY 3.0 IGO. The 20 collections under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 are left out; they are in their event subcatalogs. For every source column, use the per-event collection named in `collection`. Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the columns and query recipes.",
